    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Dungeon</strong> | A Pixel-Art Roguelike Deck-Building Adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Play as the Underdog</strong><br>You are a &quot;villain&quot; abandoned by fate, but this time, &quot;courage&quot; drives you to venture into the dungeon to save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Dynamic Battlefields</strong><br>The &quot;flow of time&quot; mechanic shatters traditional deck-building rules\u2014enemy moves, trap triggers, and even resource spawns evolve in real-time as the sands of time slip away. Every run is a brand-new puzzle to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Infinite Deck-Building Potential</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit unconventional allies like the Fallen Knight and Deceptive Warlock, each with hidden synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine 100+ tactical cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a variety of battle gear.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>The Final Challenge</strong><br>How deep does the dungeon go? No one knows\u2014but perhaps you can uncover the answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b7 <strong>Every Restart Is a Lesson Toward the Perfect Defeat</strong> \u25c1</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Dungeon</strong> | A Pixel-Art Roguelike Deck-Building Adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Play as the Underdog</strong><br>You are a &quot;villain&quot; abandoned by fate, but this time, &quot;courage&quot; drives you to venture into the dungeon to save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Dynamic Battlefields</strong><br>The &quot;flow of time&quot; mechanic shatters traditional deck-building rules\u2014enemy moves, trap triggers, and even resource spawns evolve in real-time as the sands of time slip away. Every run is a brand-new puzzle to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Infinite Deck-Building Potential</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit unconventional allies like the Fallen Knight and Deceptive Warlock, each with hidden synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine 100+ tactical cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a variety of battle gear.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>The Final Challenge</strong><br>How deep does the dungeon go? No one knows\u2014but perhaps you can uncover the answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b7 <strong>Every Restart Is a Lesson Toward the Perfect Defeat</strong> \u25c1</p>",
